{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a raster tile source initialized with an identifier and configuration"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"URL."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"instancetype","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"identifier","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configurationURL:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSURL","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSURL"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configurationURL","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A string that uniquely identifies the source in the style to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"which it is added.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"identifier"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A URL to a TileJSON configuration file describing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source’s contents and other metadata."}]}],"name":"configurationURL"}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An initialized raster tile source."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"After initializing and configuring the source, add it to a map view’s style","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"using the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The URL may be a full HTTP or HTTPS URL or canonical URL. The URL should","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"point to a JSON file that conforms to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TileJSON specification","type":"text"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If a Mapbox URL is specified, this source uses a tile size of 256. For all","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other tilesets, the default value is 512. (See the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize"},{"type":"text","text":" documentation for more information about tile"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sizes.) If you need to use a tile size other than the default, use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:tileSize:"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource\/initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNRasterTileSource(im)initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","roleHeading":"Instance Method","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:"}],"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:"}],"title":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrastertilesource\/initwithidentifier:configurationurl:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing a floating-point number that specifies the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"width and height (measured in points) at which the map displays each raster"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"image tile when the map’s zoom level is an integer. The raster tile source"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"scales its images up or down when the map’s zoom level falls between two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"integers."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntilesourceoptiontilesize","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle/addSource:":{"title":"addSource:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addSource:","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle\/addsource:","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Adds a new source to the current style.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNRasterTileSource/initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:":{"title":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnraster